{% doc %}
  Looks up a canonical ingredient key (as stored in product.metafields.nutrition.ingredient_cards)
  and outputs "Display Name|https://cdn-image-url" for the caller to capture and split. All 34 photos
  are hosted on this store's own Shopify CDN (uploaded via Admin API fileCreate). Falls back to a
  title-cased version of the key with a blank image if the key is unrecognized (e.g. halawa-root,
  which has no dedicated photo).
  @param {string} key - The canonical ingredient key, e.g. "sesame-seeds"
  @example
  {%- capture lookup -%}{%- render 'ingredient-image', key: 'pistachios' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign parts = lookup | strip | split: '|' -%}
{% enddoc %}

